<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="neutral">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Azeroth Archive | Chronicles of WoW</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700;900&family=Oswald:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">AZEROTH<span>ARCHIVE</span></div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#forever">WoW Forever</a></li>
            <li><a href="#cosmology">Cosmology</a></li>
            <li><a href="#territories">Maps</a></li>
            <li><a href="#figures">Leaders</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="theme-switcher">
            <button id="alliance-btn" class="faction-pill alliance">Alliance</button>
            <button id="horde-btn" class="faction-pill horde">Horde</button>
            <button id="neutral-btn" class="faction-pill neutral">Neutral</button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1 class="hero-title">WORLD OF <br><span>WARCRAFT</span></h1>
            <p>The definitive digital archive of the cosmology, history, and the new era of Azeroth.</p>
            <a href="#forever" class="hero-btn">Explore WoW Forever</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- WORLD OF WARCRAFT: FOREVER SECTION -->
        <section id="forever" class="reveal">
            <h2 class="section-header">WoW: Forever</h2>
            <div class="forever-container">
                <div class="forever-content">
                    <div class="forever-badge">NEW RELEASE: NOV 4, 2026</div>
                    <h3>A New Path for Azeroth</h3>
                    <p><strong>World of Warcraft: Forever</strong> is a reimagined permanent game mode that diverges from the original timeline. Set after the <em>Forsaken Kingdom</em> and before the <em>Molten Core</em>, it bridges the narrative gaps of early Azeroth.</p>

                    <div class="forever-features">
                        <div class="feat-item">
                            <span class="feat-icon">🕊️</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong>The Skyborne (Shen’dorai)</strong>
                                <p>A new playable race of Air Elves who escaped the corruption of the Shen’dralar.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feat-item">
                            <span class="feat-icon">⚔️</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Forbidden Classes</strong>
                                <p>Introducing Forsaken Paladins, Night Elf Paladins, and Dwarf Shamans.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feat-item">
                            <span class="feat-icon">📍</span>
                            <div>
                                <strong>New Lands</strong>
                                <p>Explore Zephras Isle and the Riverglades through 1,000+ new quests.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="forever-footer">
                        <p>Level Cap: <strong>60 (Permanent)</strong> | No FOMO | Constant Story Evolution</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="forever-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="WoW Forever Concept">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Cosmology Section -->
        <section id="cosmology" class="reveal">
            <h2 class="section-header">Cosmology</h2>
            <div class="modern-grid">
                <div class="modern-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464802686167-bca797c1456b?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="The Light" class="card-img">
                    <div class="modern-card-content">
                        <div class="accent-bar"></div>
                        <h3>The Light</h3>
                        <p>The force of holy energy, creation, and hope. The Light seeks to bring order and purity to the universe.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modern-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1462332420958-3676abcbe77c?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="The Void" class="card-img">
                    <div class="modern-card-content">
                        <div class="accent-bar"></div>
                        <h3>The Void</h3>
                        <p>The opposite of the Light. A chaotic force of shadows and whispers that seeks to consume all existence.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modern-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1446776811953-b23d57bd21aa?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="The Arcane" class="card-img">
                    <div class="modern-card-content">
                        <div class="accent-bar"></div>
                        <h3>The Arcane</h3>
                        <p>The energy of Order. It is the fuel for magic, allowing mages to reshape reality through logic and study.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modern-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533038590847-82077049771b?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="The Fel" class="card-img">
                    <div class="modern-card-content">
                        <div class="accent-bar"></div>
                        <h3>The Fel</h3>
                        <p>The energy of Disorder. Destructive and corrupting, Fel is the primary tool of the Burning Legion.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Maps Section -->
        <section id="territories" class="reveal">
            <h2 class="section-header">Territories</h2>
            <div class="map-container">
                <div class="map-card">
                    <div class="map-header">Political Map of Azeroth</div>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526778548025-fa27156f762c?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Azeroth Political Map" class="main-map">
                    <p class="map-desc">A strategic overview of the current territorial boundaries between the Alliance and the Horde.</p>
                    <a href="https://mosqueras.com/world-of-warcraft-political-map/" target="_blank" class="map-link">View Interactive Archive</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Figures Section -->
        <section id="figures" class="reveal">
            <h2 class="section-header">Faction Leaders</h2>

            <div class="faction-group">
                <h3 class="faction-title alliance-title">The Alliance</h3>
                <div class="modern-figures">
                    <div class="figure-pill">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Anduin" class="fig-img">
                        <div class="figure-main">
                            <span class="fig-name">Anduin Wrynn</span>
                            <span class="fig-role">High King</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Returning from isolation, Anduin leads the Alliance with diplomacy and light.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="figure-pill">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Turalyon" class="fig-img">
                        <div class="figure-main">
                            <span class="fig-name">Turalyon</span>
                            <span class="fig-role">Lord Commander / Regent</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>The military backbone of the Alliance and acting regent of Stormwind.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="figure-pill">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-120ca78dc0ca?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Jaina" class="fig-img">
                        <div class="figure-main">
                            <span class="fig-name">Jaina Proudmoore</span>
                            <span class="fig-role">Lord Admiral</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>The most powerful mage of her age and leader of Kul Tiras.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faction-group">
                <h3 class="faction-title horde-title">The Horde Council</h3>
                <div class="modern-figures">
                    <div class="figure-pill">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Thrall" class="fig-img">
                        <div class="figure-main">
                            <span class="fig-name">Thrall</span>
                            <span class="fig-role">Council Member / Orc Representative</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>The legendary former Warchief who now guides the Horde through wisdom.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="figure-pill">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Baine" class="fig-img">
                        <div class="figure-main">
                            <span class="fig-name">Baine Bloodhoof</span>
                            <span class="fig-role">High Chieftain of the Tauren</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>A pillar of peace and stability within the Horde Council.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="figure-pill">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531427186611-ec727fddaf9c?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Talanji" class="fig-img">
                        <div class="figure-main">
                            <span class="fig-name">Talanji Windrider</span>
                            <span class="fig-role">Queen of the Zandalari</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>A fierce protector of her people and a voice of strength in the council.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="logo">AZEROTH<span>ARCHIVE</span></div>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Azeroth Archive. A Learning Project.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
